{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12107050","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12107050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1210705001:0":{"text":"멈춰라.","source_cn":"站住。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5ED1E71E564F598","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1210705002:0":{"text":"형님, 무슨 일이십니까?","source_cn":"老哥，怎么了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0FA9620EDF9FC30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210705003:0":{"text":"암호를 대.","source_cn":"暗号。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A0678BE84AF9E4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210705004:0":{"text":"암호?","source_cn":"暗号？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8ECF9180C6B3C9C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210705005:0":{"text":"...아, 어제 술을 진탕 먹고 시비까지 붙어서 아직 정신이 덜 들었네요.","source_cn":"——啊，让我想想，昨天酒喝多，和人打了一架，脑子还没缓过来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE8B8C6D846ECB47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1210705006:0":{"text":"왜 암호 같은 게 있는 거죠? 정체를 들킨 게 아닐까요?","source_cn":"为什么还有暗号这种东西，我们是不是要暴露了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FB1928AFEDFDE75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1210705007:0":{"text":"신밧드, 암호가 뭔지 알아요?","source_cn":"辛巴达，你知道暗号是什么吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34EC3351802AEF69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1210705008:0":{"text":"재촉하지 마. 지금 만들어내고 있으니까.","source_cn":"急什么？正在编。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC088BC6BB7166E20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1210705009:0":{"text":"뭐라고요?!!","source_cn":"什么？！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88363543AD044CB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1210705010:0":{"text":"전투 준비해...","source_cn":"战斗准备——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF7776E9904A70CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1210705011:0":{"text":"형님, 생각났습니다!","source_cn":"哥们，我想起来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA84EC374996700E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1210705012:0":{"text":"갓 잡은 물고기인데, 살이 연하고 부드럽습니다. 받아 주십쇼.","source_cn":"刚钓的鱼，肉质鲜嫩，笑纳。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1678353404A78ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1210705013:0":{"text":"뭘 좀 아는군. 그래도 암호는...","source_cn":"算你上道，但是暗号还是要——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE12DA3575D1018A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1210705014:0":{"text":"압니다, 알아요. 여기 두 마리 더 있으니 사양 말고 가져가세요.","source_cn":"我懂，我懂，瞧我这脑子，这还有两条，都孝敬您了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58FDC80AACA797A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1210705015:0":{"text":"흥, 작작 마셔. 술독에 절여지기 전에. 가 봐.","source_cn":"哼，悠着点，别把脑子都泡酒坛里了，过去吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDEFBC7997147945","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1210705016:0":{"text":"감사합니다, 형님!","source_cn":"谢谢大哥！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53A9ECBEB39FE0B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:水鬼帮奈克":{"text":"나이크","source":"水鬼帮奈克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:辛巴达